            <a class="nounderline home-banner-tracking-flat show-mobile" target="_blank" href="@Url.Content("~/Promotion")">
                <picture>
                    <source srcset="~/www/build/styles/Images/home/item1-mobile.webp" type="image/webp" />
                    <source srcset="~/www/build/styles/Images/home/item1-mobile.jpg" type="image/jpeg" />
                    <img class="img-item img-responsive" src="~/www/build/styles/Images/home/item1-mobile.jpg" alt="Actived Home Banner" />
                </picture>
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="swiper-slide">
            <a class="nounderline home-banner-tracking-flat show-pc" target="_blank" href="@Url.Content("~/Promotion")">
                <picture>
                    <source srcset="~/www/build/styles/Images/home/item2.webp" type="image/webp" />
                    <source srcset="~/www/build/styles/Images/home/item2.jpg" type="image/jpeg" />
                    <img class="img-item img-responsive" src="~/www/build/styles/Images/home/item2.jpg" alt="Actived Home Banner" />
                </picture>
            </a>
            <a class="nounderline home-banner-tracking-flat show-mobile" target="_blank" href="@Url.Content("~/Promotion")">
                <picture>
                    <source srcset="~/www/build/styles/Images/home/item2-mobile.webp" type="image/webp" />
                    <source srcset="~/www/build/styles/Images/home/item2-mobile.jpg" type="image/jpeg" />
                    <img class="img-item img-responsive" src="~/www/build/styles/Images/home/item2-mobile.jpg" alt="Actived Home Banner" />
                </picture>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
</div>


<div class="block block-commission-boost">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="top-title">
                12BET COMMISSION BOOST
            </div>
            <div class="mid-title">
                Earn up to a whopping 50% Commission!
            </div>
            <div class="description">
                Get higher monthly commission rates with ease - simply meet the requirements below to qualify automatically!
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="block block-table">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="table-custom table-responsive">
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th width="20%">Revenue Share</th>
                        <th width="8%">Tier</th>
                        <th width="20%">Company Profit For The Month ($)</th>
                        <th width="20%">Qualified Active Members/ Month</th>
                        <th width="20%">Commission</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td rowspan="6" class="text-center">
                            <p>All Products</p>
                        </td>
                        <td class="text-center">1</td>
                        <td class="text-center">1 - 3,000</td>
                        <td class="text-center">≥ 7</td>
                        <td class="text-center">30%</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">2</td>
                        <td class="text-center">3,001 - 45,000</td>
                        <td class="text-center">≥ 7</td>
                        <td class="text-center">35%</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">3</td>
                        <td class="text-center">45,001 - 200,000</td>
                        <td class="text-center">≥ 10</td>
                        <td class="text-center">40%</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">4</td>
                        <td class="text-center">200,001 - 250,000</td>
                        <td class="text-center">≥ 20</td>
                        <td class="text-center">45%</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">5</td>
                        <td class="text-center">250,001 - Above</td>
                        <td class="text-center">≥ 50</td>
                        <td class="text-center">50%</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">6</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-center">By Invitation only</td>
                        <td class="text-center">Flat 50%</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="block block-note">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="block-child-title">
                Note
            </div>
            <div class="main-content">
                <div class="items">
                    <div class="items-number">01</div>
                    <div class="items-description">
                        If the affiliate achieves varying thresholds for [total profit per month] and [qualified active players for a month] then the commission payout will be based on the lower threshold. For instance, if the total Net loss of the affiliate's members for the current month is $46,000, and the Qualified active members are 7, the commission for the period will be <span>35%</span>.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="items">
                    <div class="items-number">02</div>
                    <div class="items-description">
                        By invitation only - If you believe you have a unique proposition that could result in significant Winloss (such as attracting VIP members), you can reach out to the affiliate manager to evaluate the proposition and determine the eligibility.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="block block-power">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="block-child-title">
                FDM's POWER
            </div>
            <div class="block-child-description">
                In 12BET, extra rewards are always guaranteed. All you need to do is fulfil the stated New FDM's requirements and receive an extra commission in addition to your commission.
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="table-custom table-responsive">
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th width="22%">NEW FDM's</th>
                        <th width="26%">TOTAL FDM's DEPOSIT ($)</th>
                        <th width="26%">EXTRA COMMISSION</th>
                        <th width="26%">MAX EXTRA COMMISSION ($)</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">5 to 11</td>
                        <td class="text-center">2,200 - 4,499</td>
                        <td class="text-center">3%</td>
                        <td class="text-center">250</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">12 to 24</td>
                        <td class="text-center">4,500- 10,499</td>
                        <td class="text-center">5%</td>
                        <td class="text-center">500</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">25 to 39</td>
                        <td class="text-center">10,500- 14,999</td>
                        <td class="text-center">8%</td>
                        <td class="text-center">1,200</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">40 &amp; Above</td>
                        <td class="text-center">15,000 &amp; Above</td>
                        <td class="text-center">12%</td>
                        <td class="text-center">2,000</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="block block-note">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="block-child-title title-spcing">
                Note
            </div>
            <div class="main-content">
                <div class="items">
                    <div class="items-description">
                        Every affiliate will receive an extra percentage in addition to the commission they earn, regardless of whether it's a Regular Commission or a 12BET Commission Boost promotion.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="block block-faq">
    <div class="block-content">
        <div class="group-anwser">
            <div class="anwser">
                <div class="anwser-heading">THE COMMISSION CALCULATION EXAMPLE:</div>
                <div class="anwser-text">
                    Imagin a ‘Affiliate XYZ’ has a <span class="red-bold">Net win/loss</span> of $35,000, and there are 25 qualified active members and 12 FDMs. The total deposit made by FDMs is $3,000. The individual qualifies for both promotions, which are the 12BET Commission Boost and FDM Power.
                </div>
                <div class="anwser-text">
                    To calculate the commission, we first apply the Commission Boost, which is 35% of $35,000, resulting in $12,250.
                </div>
                <div class="anwser-text">
                    Next, we apply FDM Power to the Commission Boost amount, which is 3%. Therefore, the FDM Power bonus is $367.5, but since the maximum bonus is $250, the commission will be $12,250 + $250 = $12,500.
                </div>
                <div class="anwser-text">
                    Thus, the total commission earned by the Affiliate XYZ is $12,500.
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="group-question">
            <div class="question">
                <div class="title">
                    <span>TERMS AND CONDITIONS</span>
                </div>
                <span class="button-toggle"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>





